{"api": 1, "name": "gate-timesync",
 "description": "TC(9,129) in obt mode (D-PLd) and the time codes' 6 LSBs (Timing.c:224-322): before a TC(9,129) the FSW counts from 0 and only moves its clock toward a code's TIMECNT when the shift is within MAX_DRIFT_FOR_SYNC (4 s) and above MIN (62.5 ms), by the median of 5 samples (ParamMgmtDef.h:541-544). So (CUC - OBT) mod 64 s is the epoch's own -LSBs unless the FSW corrected: aligned (epoch & 63 = 0) ~0; mismatch (= 32, a 32 s shift, refused) ~32 and no 0x1429; drift2 (= 2, a 2 s shift, corrected) ~0 where an uncorrected clock would be ~-2. After the sync the CUC equals the OBT in every variant. The automatic sync is off here so the state before it can be seen.",
 "duration_s": 80,
 "variants": ["aligned", "mismatch", "drift2"],
 "config": {"timesync": {"autostart": "off"}},
 "variant_config": {"mismatch": {"qemu": {"obt_epoch": 17592188141568}},
                    "drift2": {"qemu": {"obt_epoch": 17592186175488}}},
 "setup": [{"do": "platform.power.on"}],
 "steps": [
  {"at": 0, "name": "boot", "do": "platform.power.boot",
   "await_event": [{"eid": "14a3", "timeout_s": 50}],
   "assert_no_tm": ["0x5A1:1:8"]},
  {"at": 0, "name": "mismatch: no resync by the codes",
   "variants": ["mismatch"],
   "assert_no_event": [{"eid": "1429", "for_s": 58}]},
  {"at": 55, "name": "before the sync: CUC - OBT = 0 (mod 64 s)",
   "variants": ["aligned", "drift2"],
   "expect_cuc": [{"apid": "0x5E5", "mod_s": 64, "offset_s": 0,
                   "within_s": 0.3, "timeout_s": 4}]},
  {"at": 55, "name": "before the sync: CUC - OBT = 32 (mod 64 s)",
   "variants": ["mismatch"],
   "expect_cuc": [{"apid": "0x5E5", "mod_s": 64, "offset_s": 32,
                   "within_s": 0.3, "timeout_s": 4}]},
  {"at": 60, "name": "TC(9,129)", "do": "platform.timesync.send",
   "await_tm": [{"tm": "0x5A1:1:7:1dac", "timeout_s": 3}],
   "await_state": [{"path": "platform.timesync.verdict", "eq": "ok",
                    "timeout_s": 10}]},
  {"at": 66, "name": "the CUC equals the OBT",
   "expect_cuc": [{"apid": "0x5E5", "within_s": 0.3, "timeout_s": 4}]}],
 "teardown": [{"do": "platform.power.off"}]}
